{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"由华侨之乡广东省江门市体育局、江门市棋院主办、广东碧桂园杯象棋擂台赛于7月25、26日在市体育馆开赛，60名江门市、五邑地区（包括台山市、新会市、开平市、恩平市、鹤山市称为五邑）象棋高手攻擂。\r\n本次赛事采取传统的擂台争胜方式，由世界冠军、中国象棋特级大师吕钦领衔的广东象棋队队员面向江门五邑设擂，擂台赛共设三关：第一关由6名女队员上阵：陈幸琳（广东省少年女冠军）文静、陈丽淳、郑楚芳、欧阳婵娟、许妙龄。第二关由四名男队员把守：庄玉庭、黄海林、宗永生、陈富杰。第三关是擂主吕钦，经过两天角逐（每晚20时－23时）结果有11名象棋好手攻破第一关，有一名江门市好手谭展鸿攻破宗永生大师的第二关，直逼主帅吕钦。\r\n谭展鸿为江门市历届市运会、五邑地区冠军。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9a7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0a1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g9e7","comment":"红方以飞相这一“散手棋”布阵，意在避开流行变化，从而减少中“吕氏飞刀”的可能性，至此双方行棋都较为正常。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0f1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9a8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0g0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a8f8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7b2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2h2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f1h2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a1f1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f8f1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2f1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a6a5","comment":"红方主动求兑失去先手，此时黑方兵种好于红